 · Downstairs","code":"T20R0201","elements":[{"id":"63-0","name":"Mom's Welcome When You First Come Downstairs","events":["NBT-EVT-063-01"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-063-01]\n\n","points":[{"id":"63-0-0","condition":"stage A. It plays by itself the first time you come down, and never again. The two versions differ only in your friend's name. Mom walks up to you, and the music changes during the scene.","stages":["A"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-01a","NBT-DLG-063-01b","NBT-DLG-063-01c","NBT-DLG-063-01d","NBT-DLG-063-01e","NBT-DLG-063-01f"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","text":"(boy player, probably)","id":"63-0-0-block-0","gender":"male"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Hi, [Player]!\nYou’re finally awake.\n\nYour friend Lyra was just here.\n\nShe was playing hide-and-seek with\nher MARILL.\n\nOh, I almost forgot! Our acquaintance,\nProfessor Elm, was looking for you.\n\nHe said he had a favor to ask of you.\n\nYou know where the lab is, right?\nIt’s right next door to us.\n\nBy the way, do you have everything\nyou need to go out?\n\nHere, use this Bag to carry things...","id":"63-0-0-block-1","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"63-0-0-block-2","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Hi, [Player]!\nYou’re finally awake.\n\nYour friend Ethan was just here.\n\nHe was playing hide-and-seek with\nhis MARILL.\n\nOh, I almost forgot! Our acquaintance,\nProfessor Elm, was looking for you.\n\nHe said he had a favor to ask of you.\n\nYou know where the lab is, right?\nIt’s right next door to us.\n\nBy the way, do you have everything\nyou need to go out?\n\nHere, use this Bag to carry things...","id":"63-0-0-block-3","gender":"female"},{"type":"note","text":"Mom then goes on with these four lines. A chime plays with each, as you get the Bag, the Trainer Card, the Save button and the Options button. Then she walks back to her place.","id":"63-0-0-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"This is your Trainer Card...","id":"63-0-0-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Here you can save a record of\nyour progress...","id":"63-0-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"These are also rather helpful...","id":"63-0-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Just try touching the buttons, and\nyou’ll know what to do in no time.","id":"63-0-0-block-8","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m0"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01b","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m1"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01c","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene, Trainer Card line","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m2"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01d","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene, Save line","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m3"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01e","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene, Options line","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m4"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-01f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"scene, last line","condition":"var 0x4106 = 0","source":"845 S#1; 545 m5"}]}],"kind":"element","gender":"both","legacyNames":["Mom's welcome when you first come downstairs"]},{"id":"63-1","name":"Mom, When You Talk To Her","events":["NBT-EVT-063-02"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-063-02]\n\nWhat Mom says depends on how far you are in the story.\n\n","points":[{"id":"63-1-0","condition":"stages B and C, before you have a Pokémon.","stages":["B","C"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-02a"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm has been waiting for\nyou, dear. Please, go and help him.","id":"63-1-0-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"talk","condition":"flag 2404 clear, var 0x4108 < 4, flag 106 clear","source":"845 S#2; 545 m6"}]},{"id":"63-1-1","condition":"stage D, the first time you talk to her after getting your first Pokémon. She gives you the Pokégear.","stages":["D"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-02g","NBT-DLG-063-02h","NBT-DLG-063-02i","NBT-DLG-063-02j","NBT-DLG-063-02k","NBT-DLG-063-02l","NBT-DLG-063-02m"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Oh! [Player]!\nThat’s a cute Pokémon you have.\n\nProfessor Elm must have given it\nto you?\n\nOh, Professor Elm has a task for you,\nyou say?\n\nWhat kind of task?\n\n...\n\nI see. That sounds a little difficult.\n\nBut when someone makes that kind of\nrequest of you, it must be important!\n\nOh, that’s right!\nI completely forgot!\n\nYour Pokégear came back from the\nrepair shop!\n\nHere you go!","id":"63-1-1-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"[Player] received\nthe Pokégear!","id":"63-1-1-block-1","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The Pokémon Gear...\nor Pokégear, as it’s often called,\n\nis what every Trainer should have.","id":"63-1-1-block-2","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Guess what?\nYou can use the Pokégear to make a\n\nphone call, too.\n\nDo you remember how?","id":"63-1-1-block-3","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"You are asked Yes or No. Yes probably gives the first line below, No the second. Both then lead to the closing lines.","id":"63-1-1-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Just power on the Pokégear and\ntouch the telephone button, OK?","id":"63-1-1-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Select the POKéGEAR button on the\nTouch Screen. Then select the\n\ntelephone button.","id":"63-1-1-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The names of the people you can call\nare automatically registered.\n\nJust select one to give him or her\na call.\n\nWow, I can’t believe it’s so easy\nto make a phone call!","id":"63-1-1-block-7","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02g","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"talk (F#3)","condition":"flag 2404 clear, var 0x4108 < 4, flag 106 set, flag 156 clear","source":"845 F#3; 545 m7"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02h","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"system message","trigger":"after 02g (F#3)","condition":"as 02g","source":"845 F#3; 545 m8"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02i","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"after 02h (F#3)","condition":"as 02g","source":"845 F#3; 545 m9"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02j","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"after 02i; Yes/No","condition":"as 02g","source":"845 F#3; 545 m10"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02k","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"02j answered Yes","condition":"result 0","source":"845 F#3; 545 m11"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02l","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"02j answered No (F#9)","condition":"result not 0","source":"845 F#9; 545 m12"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02m","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"after 02k or 02l","condition":"always after choice","source":"845 F#9,#10; 545 m13"}]},{"id":"63-1-2","condition":"stage E, and until the end of the return scene in the lab in stage F. Every time.","stages":["E","F"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-02n"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"What’s wrong?\n\nDid you forget how to get to\nMr. Pokémon’s house?\n\nGo north on Route 30.\nTake care, dear.","id":"63-1-2-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02n","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"talk (F#8)","condition":"flag 2404 clear, var 0x4108 < 4, flags 106 and 156 set","source":"845 F#3,#8; 545 m14"}]},{"id":"63-1-3","condition":"stage F onward, the first time you talk to her. She offers to save some of your prize money. (After you beat the League this only happens if you carry the S.S. Ticket.) The first version is for before you have the first Gym Badge, the second for after.","stages":["F","G","H","I","J"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-02c","NBT-DLG-063-02d","NBT-DLG-063-02e","NBT-DLG-063-02f"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"...\nSo, you’re leaving on an adventure...\n\nOK! I’ll help, too.\nBut what can I do for you?\n\nI know!\nEvery time you receive prize money,\n\nI’ll save some of it for you.\n\nOn a long journey, money’s important.\n\nDo you want me to save\nyour money for you?","id":"63-1-3-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"I want to support you on your\nadventure, [Player].\n\nOK! I’ll help, too.\n\nBut what can I do for you?\n\nI know!\n\nEvery time you receive prize money,\nI’ll save some of it for you.\n\nOn a long journey, money’s important.\nDo you want me to save\n\nyour money for you?","id":"63-1-3-block-1","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"You are asked Yes or No. Yes: she starts saving and says the first reply below. No: she does not, and says the second.","id":"63-1-3-block-2","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"OK, I’ll take care of your money.\n\nBe careful.\n\nPokémon are your friends.\nWhen you work as a team,\n\nyou can accomplish anything!\n\nNow, go on!","id":"63-1-3-block-3","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"OK, but be careful out there.\n\nPokémon are your friends.\nWhen you work as a team,\n\nyou can accomplish anything!\n\nNow, go on!","id":"63-1-3-block-4","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02c","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"talk (F#2)","condition":"savings route, no Zephyr Badge","source":"845 F#2; 545 m15"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02d","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"talk (F#6)","condition":"savings route, badge 0 held","source":"845 F#6; 545 m16"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02e","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"savings offer answered Yes","condition":"YesNo result 0","source":"845 F#6,#7,#13; 545 m17"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"savings offer answered No","condition":"YesNo result not 0","source":"845 F#15,#24; 545 m18"}]},{"id":"63-1-4","condition":"stage F onward, every later talk once she has made the offer (after the League, only if you carry the S.S. Ticket). She opens a money menu.","stages":["F","G","H","I","J"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-063-02o","NBT-DLG-063-02p","NBT-DLG-063-02q","NBT-DLG-063-02u","NBT-DLG-063-02x","NBT-DLG-063-02r","NBT-DLG-063-02t","NBT-DLG-063-02w","NBT-DLG-063-02v","NBT-DLG-063-02s"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Hi! Welcome home!\nYou’re doing fine, I see.\n\nI’ve kept your room tidy and clean.\nOr...\n\nIs this about your money?","id":"63-1-4-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"The menu buttons are WITHDRAW, DEPOSIT MONEY, CHANGE and EXIT. Which messages go with taking money out and putting it in is judged from the button order, so it is probably right but not confirmed.","id":"63-1-4-block-1","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"EXIT (and probably also when no money changes hands):","id":"63-1-4-block-2","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Just do what you can.","id":"63-1-4-block-3","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"CHANGE asks this, and then Yes or No gives the same two replies as her first offer:","id":"63-1-4-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Do you want to save some money?","id":"63-1-4-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Taking money out, if you already carry the most money allowed:","id":"63-1-4-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"You have so much money already.\nI can’t let you have any more.","id":"63-1-4-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Taking money out, if she has nothing saved:","id":"63-1-4-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Oh!\nYou have no money saved.","id":"63-1-4-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Taking money out, when it works:","id":"63-1-4-block-10","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"[Player]\nYou should think hard how you spend it!","id":"63-1-4-block-11","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Putting money in, if she already holds the most she can:","id":"63-1-4-block-12","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"I have saved so much.\nI can’t save any more.","id":"63-1-4-block-13","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Putting money in, if you have no money:","id":"63-1-4-block-14","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Oh!\nYou have no money left to save.\n\nDon’t waste your money on\nfrivolous things, OK?\n\nI know you are sensible like me\nand that I can count on you!","id":"63-1-4-block-15","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Putting money in, when it works:","id":"63-1-4-block-16","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Your money’s safe here!\nTake care of yourself!","id":"63-1-4-block-17","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02o","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"savings menu opens (F#5)","condition":"flag 167 set, F#2 route","source":"845 F#5; 545 m20"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02p","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"touch menu labels","trigger":"after 02o","condition":"menu open","source":"845 F#5; 545 m29-32"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02q","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"63 player's house 1F","speaker":"Mom","trigger":"EXIT chosen / after transfer","condition":"menu value 1 / EXIT","source":"845 F#14,#20; 545 m21"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-063-02u","type":"Dialogue variant"